WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.750
One point deserves its own slide,
because AWS's own pages don't agree.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.613
The Health concepts page names
the newer Business Support Plus,

3
00:00:08.613 --> 00:00:11.237
Enterprise Support or Unified Operations.

4
00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:14.387
The API reference's welcome
page and the GovCloud

5
00:00:14.387 --> 00:00:17.613
page name the older Business
and Enterprise plans.

6
00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:20.638
Without a qualifying plan,
the API answers with a

7
00:00:20.638 --> 00:00:23.738
subscription-required
error, and nothing is read.

8
00:00:23.738 --> 00:00:27.291
So the chapter's advice is
simple: confirm the account's

9
00:00:27.291 --> 00:00:31.001
plan with AWS Support rather
than reading it off one page.

10
00:00:31.001 --> 00:00:35.823
The kit surfaces the error in AWS's
own words, the runbook's pre-flight

11
00:00:35.823 --> 00:00:40.440
calls the API first, and the Health
Dashboard is the interim path.
